  "subject": "Mathematics",
  "level": "Beginner",
  "lessonGoal": "Teach students the core concepts of Real Numbers.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "section-1",
      "order": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Introduction to Real Numbers",
      "text": "Real numbers are all numbers that can be placed on a number line. In this lesson, you will learn the main categories of real numbers and how they are related."
    },
    {
      "id": "section-2",
      "order": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Understanding Number Categories",
      "text": "Numbers are grouped into categories, also called sets. Some categories are smaller groups inside larger ones, so we study them one by one to understand the full real number system."
    },
    {
      "id": "section-3",
      "order": 3,
