    {
      "id": "section-16",
      "order": 16,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Comparing Number Categories",
      "text": "Natural numbers are inside whole numbers, whole numbers are inside integers, and integers are inside rational numbers. Rational and irrational numbers together make up the real numbers."
    },
